Alias K*+sig K*+
Alias K*-sig K*-
ChargeConj K*+sig K*-sig
Alias K_S0sig K_S0
Alias pi0sig pi0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.5 B+sig B- VSS;
0.5 B-sig B+ VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
1.0  K*+sig n0 anti-n0    PHSP;
Enddecay

CDecay B-sig

Decay K*+sig
0.5      K+  pi0sig                        VSS;
0.5      K_S0sig  pi+                        VSS;
Enddecay

CDecay  K*-sig

Decay K_S0sig
1.0    pi- pi+ PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay pi0sig
1.0 gamma gamma PHSP;
Enddecay

End